# The player's bullet. 8x8, drawn 1:1 to match its own hitbox exactly.
#
# rust-4 core in a rust-3 shell: the brightest thing on screen, because at this
# size brightness is the only channel that survives.
name shooter-shot
size 8 8
key o outline
key W rust-3
key A rust-4-hilite
pixels
..oooo..
.oWWWWo.
oWWAAWWo
*2 oWAAAAWo
oWWAAWWo
.oWWWWo.
..oooo..
